{100}{The Man in Black? That be Walter, the man you're pursuin'? Aye. He was a mysterious fellow. Came bustling in with his black boots and cape and was out in no time flat. Headed for Tull, I heard. Luckily, I never met the fellow, m'self.}{The Man in Black? That be Walter, the man you're pursuin'? Aye. He was a mysterious fellow. Came bustling in with his black boots and cape and was out in no time flat. Headed for Tull, I heard. Luckily, I never met the fellow, m'self.}{}{}{}{}
